        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ta̱th Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm kɛ wi̱i̱ ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm cop kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cuɛ ji̱ Juda dol kɛnɛ thok duëël Ben-ya-min, wutni ko̱o̱r ti bathdɔɔri ti kuɔ̱r wi̱cdɛ jiɛn bädäk ti ca kuany, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ thuk duëli kuec caam, kɛ ɣöö ba kuäär luɔ̱c Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu ti̱et Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa raan Kuɔth i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jio̱k ni Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm gat Thɔ-lo-mon kuäär Juda, kɛnɛ thok duëël Juda kɛ thok duëël Ben-ya-min i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nɛ mi ɛ min ca lar ɛ Kuoth Nhial ɛn ɣöö /cuarɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ maarädun. Ɛ ram ɔ loc dhɔɔrɛ, kɛ ɣöö nɔmɔ bëë kä ɣä.’ ” Inɔ cukɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial liŋ, /kenkɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ Ya-rɔ-baam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ wi̱i̱ ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m täth kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm kɛnɛ E-tam kɛ Tɛ-kowä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Beth-dhuur kɛnɛ Thoko kɛ Ä-du-lam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Gɛ̈th kɛnɛ Ma-re-ca kɛ Dhip, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Ä-do-ra-yim kɛnɛ La-kic kɛ Ä-dhe-ka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Dhɔra kɛnɛ A-ya-lon kɛ Ɣɛb-ron täth kä Juda kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ Ben-ya-min. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ täth a bum, kä cuɛ kɛ kue̱ny bööth, kä cuɛ wec ɔ ta̱th gua̱th tɔ̱wä mi̱thni, liɛɛth, kɛ kɔaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wec ɔ moc kɛ kötni kɛnɛ mutni. Inɔ cuɛ Juda kɛnɛ Ben-ya-min käp a bum.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ben Bööthni Palä kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay kä Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth palä kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay ben kä Juda wi̱i̱nikiɛn diaal tin cieŋkɛ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Lii-bay mundiɛn ba̱ny piny cukɛ ben kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ ɣöö cakɛ tuk lät palä Kuɔth ɛ Ya-rɔ-baam kɛnɛ gaatkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cɛ rɔ kuëny bööth palä kuth guäyni kɛ kolaaŋ, kɛ thääk tin cɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal tin ca lo̱ckiɛn ka̱m Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl ben kɛɛl kɛ Ji̱ Lii-bay jiɛnkɛ kä thuk duëli kuec caam wäkɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ ɣöö ba Kuoth Nhial Kuoth gua̱ni ben thöp muc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ kuäär jak kä bum kä Juda, kä cukɛ Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm gat Thɔ-lo-mon luäk kɛ run diɔ̱k ce̱tkɛ mëë lätkɛ kɛ Dee-bid kɛnɛ Thɔ-lo-mon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ Dhɔaar Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm Maa-lath nya Yɛ-ri-moth gat Dee-bid kuɛn, kä man mɔ Ä-bi-ɣa-yil nya Ɛli-ab gat Jɛthi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ da̱p gaat, Yuc kɛnɛ Cɛ-mar-yaa kɛ Dhaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Maakaa nya Ɛ̈b-ca-lom kuɛn, kä cuɛ jɛ da̱p Ä-bi-yaa kɛnɛ Ɛ̈-tay kɛ Dhi-dha kɛnɛ Cɛ-lo-mith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nhɔk ni Maaka nya Ɛ̈b-ca-lom ɛlɔ̱ŋ kä mänkɛ diaal amäni luɔɔmkɛ (tëë kɛ män wäl bädäk kɛ luɔɔm ti jiɛn bäkɛl, tëë kɛ dhɔɔl ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bädäk kɛ nyier da̱ŋ bäkɛl). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ä-bi-yaa gat Maaka kuany ala kuäär kä gaatman, kɛ ɣöö go̱o̱rɛ ɣöö bɛ jak kä kuäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ lät pɛlä, cuɛ tha̱a̱ŋ gankɛ dääk kä rɛy ciëëŋni juda kɛnɛ Ben-ya-min diaal, wi̱i̱ tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m diaal. Kä cuɛ kɛ ka̱m ti diaal, kä cuɛ kɛ moc män ti ŋuan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
